.TH std::istream_iterator::~istream_iterator 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::istream_iterator::~istream_iterator \- std::istream_iterator::~istream_iterator

.SH Synopsis
~istream_iterator();            \fI(until C++11)\fP
~istream_iterator() = default;  \fI(since C++11)\fP

Destroys the iterator, including the cached value.

If std::is_trivially_destructible<T>::value is true, then this destructor is \fI(since C++11)\fP
a trivial destructor.
